  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "Women's domestic sacrifice mapped to the woman in the kitchen",
  "description": "The top text 'both men and women sacrificed in different ways' is juxtaposed with the image of the woman in the kitchen, implying that her domestic role and sacrifices (e.g., maintaining the home) are one form of sacrifice. This creates an analogical mapping where the woman_in_kitchen is mapped as the visual representation of 'women who sacrificed' in the context of domesticity. The mapping is reinforced by the bottom text 'but it was all to protect their comfortable home,' which explicitly ties her actions to the 'comfortable home' trope, further solidifying the analogy.",
